L3-R2 DRY RUNS of the prepared owner-decision scripts, each chain on a fresh copy of the registry.
Placeholder words 'dry run', date 2026-10-01. Nothing in the tree is written. Rows L3-OD1, L3-OD2 and L3-OD4 are held
by D-22 for the tree's registry; a copy is not held, so each prepared change is exercised here. Row L3-OD4's band and
row L3-OD3's keep figures come from a FIXTURE file standing in for the checked energy basis, which is not filed yet;
the push is a placeholder of 20 N standing in for the owner's number.

